        {
          "row": 0,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2. As a result of inspection were revealed following:",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": true,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 1,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.1 Remarks for accompanying documents (none, or give comments): 1) The provided certificates are not attested in a proper way. A handwritten signature of a Customer is absent.2) The Delivery Contract specifies a different manufacturer, not the same as in the Quality certificate.",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 2,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Material’s completeness (none, or give comments): 1) The delivery contract specifies a sheet with a cut edge. In fact, a sheet with an uncut edge has been delivered.2) The steel grade differs from the contractual one.",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 3,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 4,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "2.4. Non-conformities (none, or give comments, Non-conformity report no.): NONE",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "row": 5,
          "col": 0,
          "text": "Conclusion:MATERIALS                         ☐ ACCEPTED                          ☒ REJECTED",
          "gridspan": 5,
          "vmerge": null,
          "is_header": false,
          "anchor": null
        },
